      "title": "Upcoming dividend of ₹35.00 per share",
      "body": "Eligible shareholders must have bought the stock before 23 April 2026. Payment date: 30 May 2026. Payout ratio is a comfortable 48% and this is well supported by cash flows. Trailing yield: 0.9%. Lower than top quartile of Indian dividend payers (1.5%). Higher than average of industry peers (0.6%).",
