      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-04-14T10:08:00.000Z",
      "title": "Schaeffler India Limited to Report Q1, 2026 Results on Apr 29, 2026",
      "body": "Schaeffler India Limited announced that they will report Q1, 2026 results at 12:15 PM, Indian Standard Time on Apr 29, 2026",
      "keyDevTypeId": "55",
